{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119083811471-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119100055\"/><p>意外涉及救護車及私家車。</p><p>鑽石山發生交通意外。今晨（19日）7時44分，一輛救護車沿龍翔道往荃灣方向行駛，至港鐵鑽石山站對開時，與尾隨一輛私家車相撞。事件中無人受傷，警員正調查意外原因，期間上址交通一度受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T02:23:57.864167+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:38:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T03:57:31.408921+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T02:17:34.595546+00:00","content_hash":"3b8ea3a3eb7f6c4ddc66c415c129a61ce1f4653ab5d15703a2a9897951584406","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}